  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "\"Does our innocent princess not even know about something like this? No, wait, are you a slave now?\" \n\nElia Arvid is the princess of the Luwin Kingdom, whose marriage to the Tarafego Empire is close at hand. On the very day the imperial delegation sent for the royal wedding is scheduled to arrive, Kyron Drake—a pirate feared as the demon of the Black Sea—suddenly raids the royal palace. As Elia attempts to hide herself by disguising herself as a page boy, a low, chilling voice pierces her ears. \n\n\"Who are you?\" \n\nA sharp, suffocating gaze stares right through her. Elia's eyes land on the red scar covering the back of his hand before slowly tracing upward. The moment their eyes meet, she realizes one thing: Not a single one of those terrifying rumors about him was wrong.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14143315)",
